# Rare and Common Variant Association Analysis Pipeline

## Overview

This repository contains the commands and scripts used for common and rare variant association analyses performed using \_\_PLINK\_\_ and \_\_REGENIE\_\_. The workflow includes:

1. Conversion of VCF files into PLINK binary format.
2. Calculation of allele frequencies.
3. Single-variant association analyses for:
   - Binary phenotypes.
   - Quantitative phenotypes.
4. Gene-based rare variant association analyses using SKAT-O.
5. Multiple testing correction using Bonferroni and False Discovery Rate (FDR).

The commands are provided in a generalized format to facilitate reproducibility and adaptation to other datasets.

