#Notes

All analyses were performed using PLINK binary genotype files.
Common variant analyses were conducted at the single-variant level.
Rare variant analyses were performed using gene-based aggregation tests.
Covariates included age, sex, BMI, cohort, or additional study-specific variables depending on the phenotype analyzed.
Quantitative trait analyses excluding treated individuals were performed to minimize treatment-related confounding.
False Discovery Rate correction was applied using the Benjamini-Hochberg method.
